---
config:
  flowchart:
    curve: linear
---
flowchart TD
    START([Start run]):::endpoint

    P1["Phase 1: Determine data mode<br/>(single MCP cost fetch, 90-day window<br/>+ classify Cold Start / Initial / Beginner / Normal)"]
    P2["Phase 2: Ingest daily data<br/>(pure normalization, no network)"]
    P3["Phase 3: Update metadata &amp; model<br/>(persist new services + run STL)"]
    P4["Phase 4: Detect account anomaly"]
    DEC{"Anomaly-Check router"}
    P5["Phase 5: Drill down to contributor services"]
    ALERT{"Alert-Check router"}
    P6["Phase 6: Dispatch anomaly alert<br/>(Gemini narrative over SMTP)"]
    FAIL["Dispatch failure alert<br/>(best-effort failure email)"]
    END([End run]):::endpoint

    START --> P1

    P1 -->|ok| P2
    P1 -.->|error| FAIL

    P2 -->|ok| P3
    P2 -.->|error| FAIL

    P3 -->|ok| P4
    P3 -.->|error| FAIL

    P4 --> DEC
    DEC -->|anomaly found| P5
    DEC -->|no anomaly| ALERT
    DEC -.->|error| FAIL

    P5 --> ALERT
    P5 -.->|error| FAIL

    ALERT -->|send alert| P6
    ALERT -->|nothing to send| END
    ALERT -.->|error| FAIL

    P6 --> END
    FAIL --> END

    classDef endpoint fill:#bfb6fc,stroke:#5b4fc4,color:#1a1333;
